<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The number of shares outstanding of Common Stock,
par value $0.001 per share, as of May 14, 2026, was <span id="xdx_901_edei--EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding_iI_c20260514_zGvDHjlnQxQ"><ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2026-05-14" id="Fact000042" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">42,711,301</ix:nonFraction></span> shares</p>

