<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_23F_zylIUk2csOWc" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">These warrants were issued
in conjunction with an underwritten public equity offering, therefore, there was no employee or non-employee compensation expense recognized.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><i>Stock Compensation Expense</i>
&#8211; As of March 31, 2026, we have issued Non-Qualified Stock Options to a group of our non-executive employees to purchase a total
of <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zVEeaqVAdX65" title="Grants in period, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" id="Fact000835" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">159,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock, net of forfeitures, at the then-current stock price of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zJmcFxvSfbmf" title="Share price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MinimumMember" id="Fact000837" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.04</ix:nonFraction></span> -<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zbWahTHOZTq2" title="Share price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000839" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.60</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, pursuant to the provisions
of our 2019 Stock Option Plan. These options are exercisable for a period of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2_dtY_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zlCb3P3R8rje" title="Exercisable for period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000841" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2">5</ix:nonNumeric></span> years from the date of issuance and will become vested
on a ratable basis over a period of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1_dtY_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zzv8Br6e4tck" title="Vested for period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000843" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1">3</ix:nonNumeric></span> years from the date of issuance. Using the Black-Scholes valuation model, and assuming expected
volatility of <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_dp_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zoSuYxes9ms3" title="Assuming expected volatility"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MinimumMember" id="Fact000845" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">78.6</ix:nonFraction></span>-<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_dp_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zRmxCOFv6mok" title="Assuming expected volatility"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000847" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">81.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% and current interest rate of <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_dp_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zDih2IEs5GT9" title="Current interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MinimumMember" id="Fact000849" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.1</ix:nonFraction></span>-<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_dp_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zEpSZJSnZvV7" title="Current interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000851" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.3</ix:nonFraction></span>%, we calculated that the total fair value of these options at issuance was
approximately $<span id="xdx_905_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodValue_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zbZqwGN8AlXb" title="Grant date fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="NEOV:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodValue" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" id="Fact000853" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">366,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and are amortizing this total amount to stock compensation expense on a straight-line basis over the <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm_dtY_c20250701__20260331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zxCnDH50YJE6" title="Straight-line basis over period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-012026-03-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000855" name="NEOV:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm">3</ix:nonNumeric></span>-year vesting
period of the options.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">On February 23, 2026, we issued
Non-Qualified Stock Options to two executive employees to purchase a total of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20260222__20260223__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember_zqa54akew639" title="Grants in period, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_custom_TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember" id="Fact000857" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,232,697</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock at the current stock price
of $3.54 per share, in exchange for surrender of their right to receive a total of 1,520,000 shares of restricted common stock. Using
the Black-Scholes valuation model, and assuming expected volatility of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_dp_c20260222__20260223__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zBZKEdOtzjW9" title="Assuming expected volatility"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" id="Fact000859" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">81.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% and current interest rate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_dp_c20260222__20260223__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zVW8eVqyiPec" title="Current interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" id="Fact000861" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.1</ix:nonFraction></span>%, we calculated that the
total fair value of these options at issuance was approximately $<span id="xdx_901_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodValue_c20260222__20260223__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember_zsZviAUGApI5" title="Grants in period, value"><ix:nonFraction name="NEOV:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodValue" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_custom_TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember" id="Fact000863" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">5,380,800</ix:nonFraction></span>, (see further disclosure below).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The following table presents
